<title>USA: Tekelec looking for new CEO.</title>
<headline>Tekelec looking for new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CALABASAS, Calif. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tekelec said it has started a search for a new chief executive officer to succeed Philip Alford who resigned in December. It said it hopes to fill the position by the summer.</p>
<p>The company also said that Allan Toomer has advised it that he plans to retire as president at the end of 1997, but will remain a member of the board of directors and be available to consult for the company after his retirement.</p>
</text>
